board; Notebooks → Workbenches; Data Science Pipelines → RHOAI Pipelines). No architecture-context file exists for the Documentation component; E005's team (`RHOAI Documentation`) is inferred from the strategy's statement that documentation is a separately owned work stream — verify with the actual docs team before scheduling.\n67\t- **E001 component mapping** (non-obvious): the packaging format spans Notebooks and Data Science Pipelines content and is consumed by Dashboard code. Assigned the single most-relevant canonical component `Notebooks` (tutorials are primarily notebook artifacts, and the format exists to keep them independent of Dashboard releases); the span is noted here per the component-name constraint.\n68\t- **Scope trap — tutorial maintenance**: HLR-2 requires tutorials \"tested against the current release\" and the problem statement calls them \"maintained\" tutorials, but the strategy scopes no ongoing re-validation process for future releases and the out-of-scope list does not address it. Recurring per-release re-testing effort is unplanned; the validation manifest from the packaging format mitigates but does not eliminate it.\n69\t- **Contribution process without tooling** (consistent, noted for awareness): the contribution process is documented (HLR-4) while submission tooling is explicitly out of scope — the docs must describe a process that has no tooling this release; flagged so the docs epic scopes it as process documentation only.\n70\t\n71\t## Tiered Delivery\n72\t\n73\tNot applicable — the strategy has no external dependencies with uncertain timing (Dependencies table absent; no upstream/vendor gating identified). All epics proceed on the single plan above.\n74\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-924c3c25530292cc","agent_id":"a1a52b8108f0b1d59","session_id":"3e13a806-c285-42c0-9767-e97cfc099643","uuid":"130fbf05-624a-4fc9-99df-1fbf1fcb516e","timestamp":"2026-10-26T11:36:07.468Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bf9b201f6c4bce