t\n42\t- Consistency with existing Dashboard patterns for project-scoped resource creation (the Dashboard reads and writes the platform's Kubernetes resources; it owns no data plane)\n43\t\n44\t## Acceptance Criteria\n45\t\n46\t- The Dashboard shows a tutorial gallery listing available curated tutorials with their metadata.\n47\t- From the gallery, a user can launch a tutorial into their own project with one click by opening a workbench containing the tutorial notebook.\n48\t- From the gallery, a user can launch a pipeline tutorial into their own project with one click by importing the pipeline.\n49\t- Launching a tutorial packaged in the defined tutorial packaging format succeeds end-to-end in a real project — verified with at least one tutorial from the curated set or an equivalent package conforming to the format.\n50\t- The Dashboard's existing build/CI pipeline remains green with the gallery changes.\n51\t\n52\t## HLR Traceability\n53\t\n54\t- **HLR-1 (P0)** — full coverage. The tutorial gallery in the Dashboard and the one-click launch mechanics (workbench with notebook, pipeline import) are this epic's deliverable.\n55\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-924c3c25530292cc","agent_id":"a1a52b8108f0b1d59","session_id":"3e13a806-c285-42c0-9767-e97cfc099643","uuid":"388576f9-b381-419c-9c80-59e9fbd4d8cb","timestamp":"2026-10-26T11:36:11.890Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b60f523c2be6bb65","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9019 decomposition"}
